# Google Gemini API key -- only needed if you run any stage with
# --provider gemini, or set CVTAILOR_LLM_PROVIDER=gemini (also used by
# src/ai_wrappers/py_stage08_reviewer_gemini.py, the Agent reviewer
# backend).
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# To use: copy this file to gemini_key.txt (drop the .example suffix)
# in this same folder, and replace the placeholder line below with
# your real key. gemini_key.txt is gitignored -- it will never be
# committed once created. This .example file IS tracked, so a fresh
# clone always has the right filename to fill in.
#
# The pipeline currently reads GEMINI_API_KEY from the environment
# rather than this file directly -- set the env var for now; wiring a
# direct file-based loader here is a planned follow-up, not yet
# implemented.

PLACEHOLDER_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_REAL_KEY
